"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  validate     Validate the file\n"
"  simplify     Simplify the file\n"
"  enumerate    List all named objects\n"
"  preview      Preview the file\n"
"  render       Take a screenshot of the file\n"
"  screenshot   Take a screenshot of the file\n"
"\n"
